WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.574 --> 00:00:18.738
is ridiculous," Perda thought as she dunked a dirty dinner plate into a basin of soapy water.

2
00:00:19.559 --> 00:00:21.199
She shuffled over to the kitchen door.

3
00:00:21.820 --> 00:00:23.861
Her legs were still shackled together.

4
00:00:24.641 --> 00:00:29.603
Zira had released her hands after they'd zapped to her house an hour or two earlier.

5
00:00:30.303 --> 00:00:31.924
Zira was in the courtyard garden.

6
00:00:32.404 --> 00:00:39.010
Just as Perda looked out, Zira snapped her fingers and created a tall, golden fence around the bushes

7
00:00:39.090 --> 00:00:41.532
with purple berries that Perda had noticed before.

8
00:00:43.193 --> 00:00:49.498
Those bushes were almost the only thing about Zira's house that hadn't changed since Perda had first seen

9
00:00:49.538 --> 00:00:55.403
it. Thanks to Zira's magic abilities, the house was now the largest and grandest in the village.

10
00:00:56.204 --> 00:00:57.024
"What do you want?"

11
00:00:57.625 --> 00:01:00.948
Zira asked, frowning when she noticed Perda in the doorway.

12
00:01:01.712 --> 00:01:03.893
"I told you to wash the dishes."

13
00:01:04.673 --> 00:01:05.513
"Yes, you did.

14
00:01:05.993 --> 00:01:11.975
But as I keep telling you, it would be much faster and easier with magic," Perda said.

15
00:01:12.975 --> 00:01:13.816
Zira shrugged.

16
00:01:14.296 --> 00:01:14.916
"Too bad.

17
00:01:15.556 --> 00:01:20.297
As I keep telling you, you're forbidden from using magic.

18
00:01:21.138 --> 00:01:26.279
If you ever want me to remove those shackles from your legs, you'll remember that.

19
00:01:26.899 --> 00:01:28.720
Now get back to your chores.

20
00:01:29.680 --> 00:01:34.464
I expect you to be finished with the dishes by the time I return from the village green."

21
00:01:35.345 --> 00:01:36.366
She rolled her eyes.

22
00:01:36.386 --> 00:01:42.331
"Vilkor wishes to bestow more magical favors on the townspeople this evening.

23
00:01:43.311 --> 00:01:45.233
I should be there to supervise."

24
00:01:45.954 --> 00:01:48.676
Perda was interested to hear that Zira was leaving.

25
00:01:48.696 --> 00:01:52.439
"All right," she said, trying to sound humble.

26
00:01:53.079 --> 00:01:54.360
"I'll get back to work."

27
00:01:55.762 --> 00:01:57.083
She shuffled back inside.

28
00:01:57.683 --> 00:02:02.094
Zira followed, pausing to watch as Perda picked up another dirty dish.

29
00:02:02.114 --> 00:02:05.397
"I'll be back in an hour," Zira said.

30
00:02:05.957 --> 00:02:08.859
Then she snapped her fingers and zapped out of sight.

31
00:02:09.520 --> 00:02:10.781
Perda set down the dish.

32
00:02:11.461 --> 00:02:14.383
With her hands free, it was easy to create friction.

33
00:02:15.064 --> 00:02:17.886
She quickly cleaned the rest of the dishes with magic.

34
00:02:19.347 --> 00:02:22.770
"Zira will be gone for an hour," she thought, looking around.

35
00:02:22.790 --> 00:02:25.652
"That means I have an hour to look around this place.

36
00:02:26.176 --> 00:02:29.799
Maybe Zira left some clues about what she has planned for Terrica.

37
00:02:30.420 --> 00:02:33.542
Or maybe I can figure out where she sent my friends."

38
00:02:34.323 --> 00:02:39.427
For a second Perda was tempted to zap away to try to find Zann and Mellis on her

39
00:02:39.548 --> 00:02:43.971
own. But she realized that her shackled legs would slow her down too much.

40
00:02:44.672 --> 00:02:47.694
Besides, someone might see her and tell Zira.

41
00:02:49.216 --> 00:02:53.900
"First, I'll figure out what's going on," she murmured as she shuffled into the next room.

42
00:02:54.584 --> 00:02:57.026
"Then I'll figure out how to rescue my friends."

43
00:02:58.026 --> 00:03:01.368
By the next day, Perda hadn't figured out either of those things.

44
00:03:02.149 --> 00:03:05.031
She'd searched as much as she could while Zira was away.

45
00:03:05.671 --> 00:03:07.392
But she hadn't found any clues.

46
00:03:08.133 --> 00:03:12.195
Then Zira had returned and forced her to sweep the whole house.

47
00:03:13.136 --> 00:03:15.898
By the time she finished, Perda was exhausted.

48
00:03:16.418 --> 00:03:18.860
Doing chores without magic was hard!

49
00:03:20.640 --> 00:03:24.702
To make things worse, Zira had woken her up early to do more hard work.

50
00:03:25.323 --> 00:03:31.886
At the moment Perda was busy dusting all the fancy statues, furniture, and knickknacks Zira had created to

51
00:03:31.966 --> 00:03:34.047
decorate her enormous reception room.

52
00:03:34.488 --> 00:03:35.668
There was a knock on the door.

53
00:03:36.369 --> 00:03:37.109
It was Vilkor.

54
00:03:37.129 --> 00:03:40.751
"Oh, hello, young lady," he greeted Perda.

55
00:03:41.311 --> 00:03:43.292
He peered around, wringing his hands.

56
00:03:43.312 --> 00:03:45.354
"Is my niece here with you?

57
00:03:46.054 --> 00:03:49.536
I haven't seen her since she was dragged off by those large fellows yesterday."

58
00:03:51.160 --> 00:03:54.222
Perda was surprised to see that he actually looked worried.

59
00:03:54.242 --> 00:03:56.964
"I haven't seen her, either," she said.

60
00:03:56.984 --> 00:03:58.705
"You'll have to ask Zira."

61
00:03:59.386 --> 00:04:00.526
Zira entered the room.

62
00:04:00.546 --> 00:04:02.187
"Ask me what?"

63
00:04:02.988 --> 00:04:05.169
Vilkor repeated his question about Mellis.

64
00:04:05.830 --> 00:04:09.933
"She's quite useful around the house," he added, glancing into the next room.

65
00:04:09.953 --> 00:04:12.935
"She could keep this place spotless for you."

66
00:04:12.955 --> 00:04:16.117
"Your niece isn't here," Zira said.

67
00:04:16.137 --> 00:04:20.840
"She's making herself useful at a friend's plonk farm outside of town."

68
00:04:21.704 --> 00:04:23.726
As she spoke, she snapped her fingers.

69
00:04:24.346 --> 00:04:27.268
A large fireball appeared, hovering above her hand.

70
00:04:27.849 --> 00:04:30.831
She played with it as if it were a ball spinning on her finger.

71
00:04:30.851 --> 00:04:32.252
"Why do you ask?

72
00:04:32.852 --> 00:04:35.955
Do you have a problem with my assignment of duties?"

73
00:04:36.876 --> 00:04:40.198
Vilkor gulped, his gaze trained on the fireball.

74
00:04:40.878 --> 00:04:42.280
"No, of course not.

75
00:04:42.660 --> 00:04:47.904
Mellis always was fond of animals Perda rolled her eyes.

76
00:04:48.456 --> 00:04:52.979
She could tell that Vilkor was intimidated by Zira's display of magical power.

77
00:04:52.999 --> 00:04:57.261
"That's how she's keeping him and everyone else in line," Perda thought.

78
00:04:57.281 --> 00:04:58.962
"But I'm not afraid of her.

79
00:04:59.662 --> 00:05:01.383
And now I know where Mellis is!"

80
00:05:01.403 --> 00:05:06.066
"Say," Vilkor said, still watching the spinning fireball.

81
00:05:06.086 --> 00:05:08.868
"Can you teach me how to do that?"

82
00:05:10.248 --> 00:05:13.430
Zira noticed that Perda had stopped dusting to listen.

83
00:05:13.450 --> 00:05:15.411
"Back to work, girl!"

84
00:05:15.832 --> 00:05:16.232
she said.

85
00:05:16.716 --> 00:05:18.196
"And put some effort into it.

86
00:05:18.697 --> 00:05:20.397
This room is still a mess!"

87
00:05:21.057 --> 00:05:22.778
Perda stared at her defiantly.

88
00:05:23.198 --> 00:05:27.799
Then she rubbed her hands together and magically removed everything from the room.

89
00:05:28.500 --> 00:05:33.101
The dust and dirt were gone, along with the furniture and everything else.

90
00:05:33.121 --> 00:05:36.502
"Clean enough for you now?"

91
00:05:37.022 --> 00:05:38.422
Perda asked with a smirk.

92
00:05:39.443 --> 00:05:40.603
Zira gnashed her teeth.

93
00:05:40.623 --> 00:05:42.264
"How dare you!

94
00:05:42.844 --> 00:05:46.633
Shackle!" Tight shackles appeared around Perda's wrists.

95
00:05:47.493 --> 00:05:48.593
Vilkor bit his lip.

96
00:05:49.153 --> 00:05:49.614
"Oh, dear."

97
00:05:50.494 --> 00:05:51.514
Zira pointed.

98
00:05:51.534 --> 00:05:54.595
"To your room, girl," she snarled.

99
00:05:54.615 --> 00:05:57.596
"I'll decide your punishment later."

100
00:05:58.576 --> 00:06:02.517
Pretending to be scared, Perda slunk off toward her sleeping chamber.

101
00:06:03.277 --> 00:06:06.478
Unlike the rest of the house, it wasn't large or fancy at all.

102
00:06:07.138 --> 00:06:09.959
It was barely big enough for a rough mattress on the floor.

103
00:06:11.459 --> 00:06:14.517
Once inside, Perda stood up straight and smiled.

104
00:06:15.057 --> 00:06:16.578
Her plan had worked.

105
00:06:17.219 --> 00:06:22.062
She wasn't sure how long it would be before Zira decided on her punishment, but she wasn't going

106
00:06:22.102 --> 00:06:23.263
to waste a moment.

107
00:06:23.883 --> 00:06:28.126
It wasn't easy to create friction with her wrists so tightly shackled.

108
00:06:28.807 --> 00:06:33.350
Plus, it seemed that lots of energy was required to zap out of Zira's house.

109
00:06:33.890 --> 00:06:38.534
So she rubbed her shoulder against the wall and her feet on the floor until she had built

110
00:06:38.674 --> 00:06:39.675
up enough energy.
